{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>電影《我阿爹想旅行》昨日（28日）舉行票房破千萬慶功活動，張家輝心情大好，即席大開金口獻唱助興，更隔空與鄭伊健 …</p><p></p>\n<p>電影《我阿爹想旅行》昨日（28日）舉行票房破千萬慶功活動，張家輝心情大好，即席大開金口獻唱助興，更隔空與鄭伊健合唱《我的歌》，將歌曲送給蒙嘉慧。他亦承諾票房達2千萬時，會與鍾雪瑩正式合唱電影主題曲，談到與太太關詠荷入場觀影的經歷時，更自爆兩公婆雙雙感動落淚。\n</p>\n<h2>張家輝隔空合唱鄭伊健金曲送蒙嘉慧</h2>\n<p>慶功宴上，張家輝為答謝觀眾支持，決定重現謝票場的哼歌環節，更主動提出獻唱鄭伊健名曲。他隨即手舞足蹈唱出一小段《戰無不勝》，怎料蒙嘉慧聽後一臉疑惑，即場問道：「首歌係佢咩？好似唔係……」經現場眾人提醒，張家輝才驚覺原唱其實是陳小春，隨即露出震驚表情，惹來全場大笑。他其後再隔空與鄭伊健合唱《我的歌》，將歌曲送給蒙嘉慧，場面既溫馨又搞笑。</p>\n<h2>承諾2千萬票房與鍾雪瑩獻唱</h2>\n<p>面對票房即將衝破2千萬大關，張家輝馬上轉移視線，承諾達標時必定會與同片演員鍾雪瑩正式合唱電影主題曲。當被問及會否邀請蒙嘉慧一同加入演唱陣容時，蒙嘉慧笑言唱歌跳舞向來並非自己強項而婉拒。張家輝隨即反擊並揶揄對方上次發言時險些爆粗口諧音，笑指：「佢梗係負責講嘢啦！」蒙嘉慧則透露回家後已向鄭伊健匯報失言事件，並強調：「我無講錯㗎！」對方聽罷只是一直大笑。\n</p>\n<h2>關詠荷觀看《我阿爹想旅行》落淚</h2>\n<p>這部電影除了帶來歡樂，亦蘊含不少感人情節。張家輝自認平時屬於眼淺之人，原本以為面對煽情橋段可以保持冷靜，甚至在心裡暗自吐槽：「好流」、「又嚟呢啲」。結果他與妻子關詠荷親自入場觀看《我阿爹想旅行》時，竟然雙雙被劇情打動，最終邊看邊哭並消耗了兩張紙巾。蒙嘉慧聽後亦表示相信鄭伊健日後入場觀影時同樣會感動落淚。</p>\n<h2>男網民留言戲院盡情流淚獲讚</h2>\n<p>電影上映後引發不少觀眾共鳴，當中有男網民在網上留言分享觀影感受。該名網民坦言入場前一直以為這是一部純搞笑喜劇，結果卻在漆黑戲院內被劇情觸動而盡情流淚。張家輝對此大表欣賞，公開稱讚該名男觀眾表現浪漫，並鼓勵大眾觀看電影時不需要過度壓抑個人情緒，直指：「睇戲係為咗抒發自己」。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179324337606645113_7524004456ae2b8f0b6982.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"我阿爹想旅行 張家輝 張家輝慶功宴上風騷開金口（圖片來源：IG@chungjeralwaysright）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179324337606645113_7524004456ae2b8f0b6982.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>張家輝慶功宴上風騷開金口（圖片來源：IG@chungjeralwaysright）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179324337849145054_3278222646ae2b8f2c026b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"我阿爹想旅行 張家輝 《我阿爹想旅行》票房破千萬，張家輝心情大好，唱歌助興搞熱氣氛。（圖片來源：YouTube@Viu1 HK）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179324337849145054_3278222646ae2b8f2c026b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>《我阿爹想旅行》票房破千萬，張家輝心情大好，唱歌助興搞熱氣氛。（圖片來源：YouTube@Viu1 HK）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179324338133664117_5299410686ae2b8f5c4058.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"我阿爹想旅行 張家輝 蒙嘉慧笑言唱歌跳舞唔係強項，張家輝即接話：「佢梗係負責講嘢啦！」（圖片來源：YouTube@Viu1 HK）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179324338133664117_5299410686ae2b8f5c4058.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>蒙嘉慧笑言唱歌跳舞唔係強項，張家輝即接話：「佢梗係負責講嘢啦！」（圖片來源：YouTube@Viu1 HK）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179194948830511416_8733225596acefab0d30cc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"我阿爹想旅行 張家輝 （圖片來源：《我阿爹想旅行》海報）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179194948830511416_8733225596acefab0d30cc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：《我阿爹想旅行》海報）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178998621308612371_12484724606ab105a565a88.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"我阿爹想旅行 張家輝 （圖片來源：YouTube@GoldenSceneHK）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178998621308612371_12484724606ab105a565a88.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube@GoldenSceneHK）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%bc%b5%e5%ae%b6%e8%bc%9d/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張家輝</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%88%91%e9%98%bf%e7%88%b9%e6%83%b3%e6%97%85%e8%a1%8c/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">我阿爹想旅行</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%92%99%e5%98%89%e6%85%a7/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蒙嘉慧</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：IG@chungjeralwaysright、YouTube@Viu1 HK、《我阿爹想旅行》海報、YouTube@GoldenSceneHK資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3531884\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nOct 29 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T04:41:26.173816+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1470,"images":5,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T03:09:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T06:59:30.110801+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T04:38:35.372959+00:00","content_hash":"b35f0347ad3e4eafd11ae03e789fda2afab999dd58f9b8191652e5b30b2df487","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}